    "WalletTranschipsCard_1001": "<color=#FFFFFFFF>Prompt</color>\\n1.You have to pay {0} as service fee when withdrawing\\n2.Achievement flow can obtain the credit of withdraw service fee, the ratio is 1:1 \\n3.Achievement means sum of the abs. of games results you played\\n4. Rewarded UC are not withdrawable originally, after every game, your new achievement will make UC withdrawable, the transform ratio is 1:1\\n5.Rewarded UC can only be transformed by new achievement after rewarding.",
