    "Uiclubrechargeconfirmorderfailed": "Operation failed",
    "UITeaxinDeailt": "1. Activate insurance when all players are All-in\\n\\n2. Purchase by the player with the largest current card type. If there are multiple pots, the player who leads the largest pot will buy it, and only the largest pot can be purchased\\n\\n3. Insurance is only sold for all-in situations with 3 players in the pot or less.\\n\\n4.Three cards on the flop cannot be insured, the insured amount on the turn shall not exceed 0.25*pot, and the insured amount for river cards shall not exceed 0.5*pot\\n\\n5. If the turn card purchase insurance is not successful, the river card must purchase all outs, and the payout of the river card must be greater than the insured amount of the turn card\\n\\n6. If the player only buys part of the replacement card, the system will automatically purchase the remaining replacement card to avoid the risk of the player being BB and bring back the player's insurance amount\\n\\n7.Insurance data displayed in the [Real-time Achievement] [Approval of the previous game] and [Details of the game] in the career\\n\\n8.Texas,Omaha, when the outs exceed 30, the insurance is not activated",
    "UITeaxinDeailt_PeiFu": "1. Break-even: payout equals the amount you invested.\\n\\n2. Full pot: profit is the same whether the insurance hits or not.\\n\\n3. The UC premium is taken from the pot.\\n\\n4. If it hits, the system pays you according to the odds.\\n\\n5. If it does not hit, the system keeps the premium.",
