    "UIGuildMemberOperationGiveTypeText": "Issue Type",
    "UIGuildMemberOperationGiveTypeTip": "Time are based on UTC+0. \\n1, choose to issue by day, every these days to issue a rebate (fill in the range of 1-30), set the next day 0:00 effective. \\n2, choose to issue by week, every these weeks to issue a rebate (fill in the range of 1-30), set the next day after 0:00 effective. Issue time is every Monday. \\n3, after modifying the cycle setting, the next day 0:00 starts to execute the new cycle, and the previously unissued portion will be issued to the player.",
