    "UICreateClubJackpotTemplate_JackpotMinWhy": 'If the active pot is less than the "Pool does not trigger Jackpot contribution" setting, the contribution won\'t be deducted regardless of the amount of profit made.',
    "UICreateClubJackpotTemplate_JackpotPutWhy": 'The Jackpot will only be awarded if the player\'s contribution to the pot reaches the "Contribute to the pot to trigger the Jackpot" setting.',
    "UICreateClubJackpotTemplate_AllTableWhy": "If the percentage of the final prize is less than 100, the rest is divided equally among the other players at the table.",
