    "UIMineMallUSDTShopDiamondWholesalerTip": "Notification of Diamond Wholesaler Application",
    "UIMineMallUSDTShopDiamondWholesalerContent": "1\u3001Application fee is {0} diamonds, refunded if rejected;\\n2\u3001After approval, exclusive diamonds must be purchased within 60 days, or qualification expires;\\n3\u3001Expired or rejected applications require re-application with a fee of {1} diamonds;\\n4\u3001We will contact you via system message. Please check.",
    "UIMineMallUSDTShopDiamondWholesalerPay": "Pay {0} diamonds",
    "UIMineMallUSDTShopDiamondWholesalerWhy": "Advantages of Diamond Wholesalers\\n1\u3001No fees for transferring diamonds\\nNon-wholesalers pay 10% transfer fee in-game.\\n\\n2\u3001Dedicated diamond transfer page\\nNon-wholesalers must join and sit at a table to transfer diamonds.\\n\\n3\u3001No daily transfer limits\\nNon-wholesalers are limited by daily quotas.\\n\\n4\u3001Higher cashback rates.\\n\\nFAQ:\\n1\u3001Q: How to become a wholesaler?\\nA: Apply on the exclusive diamond purchase page. Approval makes you a wholesaler.\\n\\n2\u3001Q: Does it expire?\\nA: Privileges expire 60 days after purchase. Renew to refresh.\\n\\n3\u3001Q: Can gifted diamonds be re-gifted?\\nA: System-gifted diamonds cannot, but player-gifted ones can.",
    "UIMineMallUSDTShopDiamondWholesalerGiveTip": "Gift {0} diamonds",
