    "Mahjong_StandardRuleTitle21": "Horse Betting Introduction:",
    "Mahjong_StandardRuleContent21_1": 'Horse betting can only be chosen in the "self-draw only" winning mode, and only the winner of a self-draw win can place horse bets;',
    "Mahjong_StandardRuleContent21_2": 'After the game ends with a winning hand, the horse cards are revealed by the winning player, drawn randomly from the remaining wall or a new deck (room option), based on card points: Characters, Bamboo, Dots 1, 5, 9, and East Wind are "winning horses," while others are "losing horses";',
    "Mahjong_StandardRuleContent21_3": "If the remaining wall does not have enough horse cards, only the available cards will be revealed;",
    "Mahjong_StandardRuleContent21_4": 'If "winning horses" are drawn, each "winning horse" card corresponds to a double payout from each of the three non-winning players for the winning hand type; if "losing horses" are drawn, no payout is made;',
    "Mahjong_StandardRuleContent21_5": "Kong cards are not included in the settlement of horse card wins or losses;",
    "Mahjong_HorseNewCardTips": "(Open horses with another deck)",
