    "UICreateTableSquidSingleTips": "A player can only obtain one squid. When only one player has not obtained a squid in this round, the squid game ends, and the player without the squid mark makes a payout.\\nSquid Bonus = Set Squid Value\\nPayout Amount = Number of Squids in This Round * Value per Squid",
    "UICreateTableSquidMubleTips": 'A player can obtain multiple squids. When the round reaches the "squid limit" or "only one player has not obtained a squid," the round ends. Players without squids make individual payouts, and players with more squids receive greater rewards.\\nSquid Bonus = Number of Squids Held * Value per Squid * Number of Players Without Squids\\nPayout Amount per Person = Number of Squids Generated in This Round * Value per Squid',
