    "UIClub_InsertSuperLink": "Insert hyperlink",
    "UIGuildFundRecordTip": "Record",
    "ServerErrorCode_20047": "Buy-in request failed, please contact your club's CS",
    "UIEVInsuranceRuler": "EV Insurance:\\n1. Advantages and who it suits\\n- Locks part of an all-in result so you keep a floor while still playing aggressively, and it cuts Bad Beat swings.\\n- Best for players who want a rational risk/reward balance in high-variance games.\\n2. Eligibility\\n- After you go all-in, once the flop is out and all all-in hole cards are shown, you may buy EV insurance if you are ahead and pot equity is 60% or more.\\n- Available in Hold'em, Omaha and Short Deck (6+).\\n3. Payout\\n- Formula:\\nEV payout = [(pot \u2212 service fee \u2212 Jackpot contribution) \xD7 equity] \xD7 99%\\n- This pays according to your equity and charges a 1% fee.\\n4. Choice and settlement\\n- Paid after the hand, win or lose.\\n- No choice in time is treated as a decline.\\n- If you accept, you leave the pot and cannot win it.\\n- In multi-pot hands, only the leader with the highest qualifying equity can buy.\\n",
    "UILowWaterInsuranceRuler": "Low Water Insurance:\\n\\n1. Advantages and who it suits\\n- Low cost, high payout: buy less, get paid more. Odds are usually higher than classic insurance.\\n- For the leader of the largest pot who wants to cut Bad Beat swings.\\n\\n2. Eligibility\\n- Only the largest-pot leader may buy, up to the amount they have invested in that pot.\\n- Limits:\\n- Off if the largest pot has more than 3 players, or more than one leader with the same hand.\\n- On the turn, cover cannot exceed 1/3 of the pot. If the turn policy does not hit and the river still has outs, you must buy again and the turn cover is brought back.\\n\\n3. Odds\\n- Odds = remaining cards / remaining Outs \xD7 0.9 \u2212 1, rounded down to one decimal place.\\n\\n4. Choice and payment\\n- When eligible, buy all or none. Partial Outs are not supported.\\n- If a turn policy does not hit and a river comeback is still possible, you must buy again and the turn cover is brought back.\\n- Only plans with odds above 0.1 are offered; otherwise you cannot buy.\\n",
    "UIUpBlindTips": "Blinds will increase after this hand",
