    "UILoginConfirmContent": "Please read on",
    "UIJackpot_Introduce": "<b><size=50>Jackpot Introduction</size></b>\\nJackpot is a random big prize feature at the table. After meeting the specified hand conditions and completing a showdown, you have a chance to trigger the Jackpot prize.\\n\\n<b><size=50>Trigger Conditions</size></b>\\n1.Form the specified big hand using your hole cards;\\n2.Be defeated by a stronger hand;\\n3.The round must end with a normal showdown;\\n4.The table must meet the minimum number of participants.\\n\\n<b><size=50>Reward Rules</size></b>\\n1.The Jackpot pool accumulates continuously with each round;\\n2.Upon triggering, rewards will be distributed according to the rules;\\n3.Rewards will be given to the triggering player, the winning player, and other players at the table.\\n\\n<b><size=50>Reminder</size></b>\\nDifferent blind tables have different Jackpot pools and reward amounts. The higher the blind, the higher the reward.",
