    "WalletTranschipsBindingAlipay_RUkX0Q": "Ghi ch\xFA:\\n1. Vui l\xF2ng nh\u1EADp \u0111\xFAng s\u1ED1 t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Alipay. Khi r\xFAt UC t\u1EEB Alipay, s\u1ED1 ti\u1EC1n \u0111\xF3 s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chuy\u1EC3n tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp v\xE0o t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Alipay. Vui l\xF2ng tham kh\u1EA3o d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 kh\xE1ch h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EC3 s\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED5i s\u1ED1 t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n.\\n2. Vui l\xF2ng nh\u1EADp t\xEAn Alipay ch\xEDnh x\xE1c, n\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c chuy\u1EC3n v\xE0o t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c.",
