    "WalletTranschipsBindingCard_8d9iCb": "L\u01B0u \xFD: 1. Vui l\xF2ng nh\u1EADp \u0111\xFAng s\u1ED1 t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n th\u1EBB ng\xE2n h\xE0ng. Khi r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n t\u1EEB th\u1EBB ng\xE2n h\xE0ng s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chuy\u1EC3n th\u1EB3ng v\xE0o s\u1ED1 t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n th\u1EBB ng\xE2n h\xE0ng. Vui l\xF2ng tham kh\u1EA3o d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 kh\xE1ch h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EC3 s\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED5i s\u1ED1 t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n.\\n2. Th\u1EBB ng\xE2n h\xE0ng ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c li\xEAn k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi 2 s\u1ED1 ID.",
    "WalletTranschipsBindingCard_tishi": "\u0110i\u1EC1n ch\xEDnh x\xE1c th\xF4ng tin th\u1EBB ng\xE2n h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o UC l\xE0 Th\xE0nh c\xF4ng. N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n c\xF3 b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 c\xE2u h\u1ECFi n\xE0o, vui l\xF2ng li\xEAn h\u1EC7 v\u1EDBi b\u1ED9 ph\u1EADn ch\u0103m s\xF3c kh\xE1ch h\xE0ng",
    "WalletTranschipsBindingCard_rightNowAdd": "Th\xEAm ngay",
    "UIData_ShowProblem_zIwG": "D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n",
    "UIData_ShowProblem_eZys": "D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u n\xE2ng cao c\u1EE7a th\xE0nh vi\xEAn VIP",
    "UIData_ShowProblem_SM0y": "T\u1ED5ng s\u1ED1 v\xE1n b\xE0i: t\u1ED5ng s\u1ED1 v\xE1n b\xE0i m\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i \u0111\xE3 ch\u01A1i trong Crazy Poker\\n\\nT\u1ED5ng s\u1ED1 v\xE1n: T\u1ED5ng s\u1ED1 v\xE1n m\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i \u0111\xE3 ch\u01A1i trong Crazy Poker\\n\\nVPIP: T\u1EF7 l\u1EC7 b\xE0i c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u01B0a v\xE0o pool \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u01A1i (Ante kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xEDnh v\xE0o pool v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i c\u1EA7n ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng call ho\u1EB7c raise); S\u1ED1 l\u1EA7n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i v\xE0o b\u1EC3/t\u1ED5ng \u200B\u200Bs\u1ED1 v\xE1n b\xE0i\\n\\nVPIP Wins: T\u1EF7 l\u1EC7 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i th\u1EAFng b\u1EB1ng b\xE0i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u01B0a v\xE0o pool.\\n\\nTh\xE0nh t\xEDch trung b\xECnh m\u1ED7i tr\u1EADn: s\u1ED1 \u0111i\u1EC3m trung b\xECnh \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c/m\u1EA5t m\u1ED7i tr\u1EADn. C\xE1ch t\xEDnh l\xE0 l\u1EA5y t\u1ED5ng b\u1EA3n ghi chia cho t\u1ED5ng s\u1ED1 v\xE1n ch\u01A1i.\\n\\nS\u1ED1 l\u1EA7n mua trung b\xECnh m\u1ED7i tr\u1EADn: s\u1ED1 \u0111i\u1EC3m mua trung b\xECnh m\u1ED7i tr\u1EADn. C\xE1ch t\xEDnh l\xE0 t\u1ED5ng s\u1ED1 ti\u1EC1n mua v\xE0o chia cho t\u1ED5ng s\u1ED1 tr\u1EADn \u0111\u1EA5u.",
    "UIData_ShowProblem_3xqp": "VPIP: % hand v\xE0o pot preflop (Ante kh\xF4ng t\xEDnh). \u0110o loose/tight.\\n\\nPFR: raise preflop / hand VPIP.\\n\\n3-bet: re-raise sau raise / hand VPIP.\\n\\nC-bet: bet ti\u1EBFp sau khi lead street tr\u01B0\u1EDBc.\\n\\nAF: cao h\u01A1n = aggressive h\u01A1n (bet/raise vs call). {\uFF08\u4E0B\u6CE8\u7684\u6B21\u6570+\u52A0\u6CE8\u7684\u6B21\u6570\uFF09/\u8DDF\u6CE8\u7684\u6B21\u6570}/50 (tr\u1EA7n 100%; g\u1ED1c t\u1ED1i \u0111a 50).\\n\\nWTSD: % flop th\u1EA5y r\u1ED3i v\xE0o showdown.\\n\\nAll-in Wins: winrate khi all-in (cao = \xEDt bluff).\\n\\nVPIP Wins: winrate c\xE1c hand VPIP.",
