    "WalletTranschipsCard_1001": "<color=#FFFFFFFF>L\u01B0u \xFD</color>\\n1. N\u1EBFu doanh thu c\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EA1t 1 l\u1EA7n s\u1ED1 UC r\xFAt, ph\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFu s\u1EBD ch\u1ECBu ph\xED {0}.\\n2. Doanh thu c\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o h\u1EA1n m\u1EE9c mi\u1EC5n ph\xED r\xFAt UC theo t\u1EF7 l\u1EC7 1:1.\\n3. Doanh thu c\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xE0 t\u1ED5ng gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB tuy\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED1i l\xE3i/l\u1ED7 c\u1EE7a c\xE1c v\xE1n \u0111\xE3 tham gia.\\n4. GC kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 r\xFAt hi\u1EC7n ch\u1EC9 g\u1ED3m GC h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng t\u1EB7ng. M\u1ED7i 1GC doanh thu s\u1EBD chuy\u1EC3n 1GC kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 r\xFAt th\xE0nh GC c\xF3 th\u1EC3 r\xFAt, quy\u1EBFt to\xE1n t\u1EEBng v\xE1n.\\n5. GC kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 r\xFAt m\u1EDBi ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chuy\u1EC3n b\u1EB1ng doanh thu m\u1EDBi.",
