    "UINiuZai_Betting_area": "Khu v\u1EF1c c\xE1 c\u01B0\u1EE3c",
    "UINiuZaiInsurance_titleOne": "Khu v\u1EF1c c\xE1 c\u01B0\u1EE3c [Nh\u1EADn ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng v\u1EDBi t\u1EF7 l\u1EC7 c\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng]",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content01": "1. Khu v\u1EF1c th\u1EAFng, thua v\xE0 h\xF2a: Cao b\u1ED3i th\u1EAFng, h\xF2a, B\xF2 th\u1EAFng;",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content02": "2. B\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 khu v\u1EF1c b\xE0i tr\xEAn tay n\xE0o: qu\xE2n b\xE0i tu\xF4n ra/th\u1EBB k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i/th\u1EBB k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p, \u0111\xF4i \xC1t;",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content03": "3. Khu v\u1EF1c lo\u1EA1i th\u1EBB th\u1EAFng: b\xE0i cao/m\u1ED9t c\u1EB7p, hai c\u1EB7p, ba \u0111\u1ED3ng lo\u1EA1i/x\u1EA3 th\u1EB3ng, full house, king kong/x\u1EA3 th\u1EB3ng/x\u1EA3 ho\xE0ng gia",
    "UINiuZai_high_one": "Th\u1EBB/c\u1EB7p cao",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content04": "Vua T\xF4ng",
    "UINiuZaiInsurance_titleTwo": "C\u1EE1 qu\xE2n b\xE0i [b\u1EA5t k\u1EC3 ch\u1EA5t g\xEC]",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content05": "1. Lo\u1EA1i b\xE0i: King of Tong>Four of a Kind>Four of a Kind>Full House>Flush>Th\u1EB3ng>Ba of a Kind>Hai \u0111\xF4i>\u0110\xF4i>",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content06": "Th\u1EBB cao;",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content07": "2. Th\u1EBB \u0111\u01A1n: A>K>Q>J>10>9>8>7>6>5>4>3>2;",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content08": "3. C\xF9ng lo\u1EA1i th\u1EBB: so s\xE1nh th\u1EBB \u0111\u01A1n l\u1EDBn nh\u1EA5t tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, n\u1EBFu th\u1EBB gi\u1ED1ng nhau th\xEC ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c so s\xE1nh xu\u1ED1ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi, ch\u1EB3ng h\u1EA1n nh\u01B0 5 th\u1EBB",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content09": "N\u1EBFu c\xE1c qu\xE2n b\xE0i gi\u1ED1ng nhau th\xEC l\xE0 h\xF2a;",
    "UINiuZaiInsurance_titleThree": "Lu\u1EADt",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content011": "Khi s\u1ED1 chip c\xF2n l\u1EA1i c\u1EE7a nh\xE0 c\xE1i kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EC3 b\xF9 \u0111\u1EAFp cho t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i th\u1EAFng cu\u1ED9c th\xEC s\u1ED1 chip c\xF2n l\u1EA1i c\u1EE7a nh\xE0 c\xE1i",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content012": "S\u1ED1 \u0111i\u1EC3m c\xF2n l\u1EA1i s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE2n b\u1ED5 cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng theo t\u1EF7 l\u1EC7 v\xE0 s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EA3i quy\u1EBFt sau khi vi\u1EC7c gi\u1EA3i quy\u1EBFt ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t.",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content013": "gi\u1EEFa",
