    "UITexasRule_Introduce": "<b><size=50>Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u</size></b>\\nHold'em, tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i poker b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u \u1EDF Texas v\xE0o \u0111\u1EA7u n\u0103m 20 v\xE0 l\xE0 tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i poker c\xF4ng c\u1ED9ng ph\u1ED5 bi\u1EBFn nh\u1EA5t \u1EDF Ch\xE2u \xC2u v\xE0 Hoa K\u1EF3 v\u1EDBi l\u1ECBch s\u1EED h\xE0ng tr\u0103m n\u0103m. Hold'em l\xE0 m\u1ED9t tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i poker \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi y\xEAu th\xEDch c\u1EDD vua v\xE0 b\xE0i tr\xEAn to\xE0n th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi y\xEAu th\xEDch.\\n\\n<b><size=50>C\xE1ch ch\u01A1i</size></b>\\n1.Hold'em c\xF3 t\u1ED5ng c\u1ED9ng b\u1ED1n v\xF2ng;\\n2.Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc V\xF2ng Flop: M\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i s\u1EBD nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c 2 l\xE1 b\xE0i v\xE0 sau \u0111\xF3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn;\\n3.Flop: Sau khi chia ba l\xE1 b\xE0i chung, nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i c\xF2n l\u1EA1i \u1EDF v\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn s\u1EBD b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng th\u1EE9 hai;\\n4.Turn: V\xF2ng th\u1EE9 ba sau khi chia l\xE1 b\xE0i chung th\u1EE9 4;\\n5.River: V\xF2ng 4 sau khi chia l\xE1 b\xE0i c\xF4ng khai th\u1EE9 5; sau khi tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i k\u1EBFt th\xFAc, t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i c\xF2n l\u1EA1i ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0a b\xE0i c\u1EE7a m\xECnh ra v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i c\xF3 b\xE0i cao nh\u1EA5t s\u1EBD th\u1EAFng v\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA5u.\\n\\n<b><size=50>K\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc b\xE0n tay:</size></b>\\nRoyal Flush > Straight Flush > Four of a Kind > Full House > Flush > Straight > Trips > Two Pair > One Pair > High Card\\nK\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc b\xE0n tay:\\nA>K>Q>J>10>9>8>7>6>5>4>3>2, b\u1EA5t k\u1EC3 b\u1ED9 \u0111\u1ED3\\n\\n",
    "UIPlO4Rule_Introduce": "<b><size=50>Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u</size></b>\\nOmaha gi\u1ED1ng Hold\u2019em nh\u01B0ng m\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF3 4\u20136 l\xE1 t\u1EA9y. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i b\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c d\xF9ng \u0111\xFAng 2 l\xE1 t\u1EA9y v\xE0 3 l\xE1 chung \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o b\xE0i m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t.\\n\\n<b><size=50>PLO4</size></b>\\nTrong Pot-Limit Omaha, m\u1EE9c c\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED1i \u0111a b\u1EB1ng pot. \u201C4\u201D ngh\u0129a l\xE0 m\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chia 4 l\xE1 t\u1EA9y.\\n\\n<b><size=50>C\xE1ch ch\u01A1i</size></b>\\n1.Omaha c\xF3 b\u1ED1n v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c;\\n2.Pre-flop: m\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chia 4 l\xE1, r\u1ED3i b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EA7u;\\n3.Flop: chia 3 l\xE1 chung, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n l\u1EA1i v\xE0o v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EE9 hai;\\n4.Turn: chia l\xE1 chung th\u1EE9 4, b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EE9 ba;\\n5.River: chia l\xE1 chung th\u1EE9 5, b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EE9 t\u01B0;\\n6.Sau v\xF2ng cu\u1ED1i, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n l\u1EA1i ng\u1EEDa b\xE0i; b\xE0i m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t th\u1EAFng pot.\\n\\n<b><size=50>Th\u1EE9 h\u1EA1ng b\xE0i:</size></b>\\nRoyal Flush>Straight Flush>Four of a Kind>Full House>Flush>Straight>Three of a Kind>Two Pair>One Pair>High Card\\nTh\u1EE9 h\u1EA1ng l\xE1: \\nA>K>Q>J>10>9>8>7>6>5>4>3>2, kh\xF4ng ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t ch\u1EA5t\\n\\n",
    "UIPlO5Rule_Introduce": "<b><size=50>Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u</size></b>\\nOmaha gi\u1ED1ng Hold\u2019em nh\u01B0ng m\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF3 4\u20136 l\xE1 t\u1EA9y. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i b\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c d\xF9ng \u0111\xFAng 2 l\xE1 t\u1EA9y v\xE0 3 l\xE1 chung \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o b\xE0i m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t.\\n\\n<b><size=50>PLO5</size></b>\\nTrong Pot-Limit Omaha, m\u1EE9c c\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED1i \u0111a b\u1EB1ng pot. \u201C5\u201D ngh\u0129a l\xE0 m\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chia 5 l\xE1 t\u1EA9y.\\n\\n<b><size=50>C\xE1ch ch\u01A1i</size></b>\\n1.Omaha c\xF3 b\u1ED1n v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c;\\n2.Pre-flop: m\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chia 5 l\xE1, r\u1ED3i b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EA7u;\\n3.Flop: chia 3 l\xE1 chung, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n l\u1EA1i v\xE0o v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EE9 hai;\\n4.Turn: chia l\xE1 chung th\u1EE9 4, b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EE9 ba;\\n5.River: chia l\xE1 chung th\u1EE9 5, b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EE9 t\u01B0;\\n6.Sau v\xF2ng cu\u1ED1i, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n l\u1EA1i ng\u1EEDa b\xE0i; b\xE0i m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t th\u1EAFng pot.\\n\\n<b><size=50>Th\u1EE9 h\u1EA1ng b\xE0i:</size></b>\\nRoyal Flush>Straight Flush>Four of a Kind>Full House>Flush>Straight>Three of a Kind>Two Pair>One Pair>High Card\\nTh\u1EE9 h\u1EA1ng l\xE1: \\nA>K>Q>J>10>9>8>7>6>5>4>3>2, kh\xF4ng ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t ch\u1EA5t\\n\\n",
    "UIPlO6Rule_Introduce": "<b><size=46>Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u</size></b>\\nOmaha gi\u1ED1ng Hold\u2019em nh\u01B0ng m\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF3 4\u20136 l\xE1 t\u1EA9y. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i b\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c d\xF9ng \u0111\xFAng 2 l\xE1 t\u1EA9y v\xE0 3 l\xE1 chung \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o b\xE0i m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t.\\n\\n<b><size=46>PLO6</size></b>\\nTrong Pot-Limit Omaha, m\u1EE9c c\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED1i \u0111a b\u1EB1ng pot. \u201C6\u201D ngh\u0129a l\xE0 m\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chia 6 l\xE1 t\u1EA9y.\\n\\n<b><size=46>C\xE1ch ch\u01A1i</size></b>\\n1.Omaha c\xF3 b\u1ED1n v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c;\\n2.Pre-flop: m\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chia 6 l\xE1, r\u1ED3i b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EA7u;\\n3.Flop: chia 3 l\xE1 chung, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n l\u1EA1i v\xE0o v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EE9 hai;\\n4.Turn: chia l\xE1 chung th\u1EE9 4, b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EE9 ba;\\n5.River: chia l\xE1 chung th\u1EE9 5, b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EE9 t\u01B0;\\n6.Sau v\xF2ng cu\u1ED1i, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n l\u1EA1i ng\u1EEDa b\xE0i; b\xE0i m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t th\u1EAFng pot.\\n\\n<b><size=46>Th\u1EE9 h\u1EA1ng b\xE0i:</size></b>\\nRoyal Flush>Straight Flush>Four of a Kind>Full House>Flush>Straight>Three of a Kind>Two Pair>One Pair>High Card\\nTh\u1EE9 h\u1EA1ng l\xE1: \\nA>K>Q>J>10>9>8>7>6>5>4>3>2, kh\xF4ng ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t ch\u1EA5t\\n\\n",
    "UI6Plus_Introduce": "<b><size=46>6+Hold'em</size></b>\\n6+ Hold'em l\xe0 một tr\xf2 chơi poker \"Short Deck\" phổ biến hầu hết tu\xe2n theo Luật giống như Hold'em nhưng c\xf3 một v\xe0i điểm kh\xe1c biệt th\xfa vị:\\n1. Tất cả c\xe1c l\xe1 b\xe0i dưới 6 sẽ bị x\xf3a khỏi bộ b\xe0i;\\n2.Cược v\xe0 ante của mọi người\\n3. Mức xả cao hơn to\xe0n bộ ng\xf4i nh\xe0 v\xe0 A, 6, 7, 8, 9 được ph\xe2n loại l\xe0 mức thẳng thấp nhất.\\nĐộc quyền tại New Poker, 6+ Hold'em mang đến cho bạn cơ hội chơi một tr\xf2 chơi đầy t\xednh năng được những người chơi ưa mạo hiểm tr\xean khắp thế giới y\xeau th\xedch.\\n\\n",
