    "UIMine_Backpack_ChipsVoucherDescriptions": "minh h\u1ECDa:\\nSau khi s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng, {0} UC s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\xEAm tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp v\xE0o t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n UC v\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 r\xFAt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c.",
