    "UIHappyShop_Super1WinLuckNewsTC": 'Ch\xFAc m\u1EEBng b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng may m\u1EAFn trong s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n mua m\u1ED9t nh\xE2n d\xE2n t\u1EC7, vui l\xF2ng ki\u1EC3m tra Chi ti\u1EBFt tr\xFAng th\u01B0\u1EDFng t\u1EA1i "Mua m\u1ED9t nh\xE2n d\xE2n t\u1EC7" - "Gi\u1EA3i th\u01B0\u1EDFng c\u1EE7a t\xF4i"!',
