    "UIGuildMemberOperationGiveTypeTip": "Th\u1EDDi gian d\u1EF1a tr\xEAn UTC+0.\\n1, h\xE3y ch\u1ECDn ph\xE1t h\xE0nh n\xF3 h\xE0ng ng\xE0y v\xE0 kho\u1EA3n gi\u1EA3m gi\xE1 s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE1t h\xE0nh v\xE0o nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y n\xE0y (\u0111i\u1EC1n v\xE0o ph\u1EA1m vi 1-30) v\xE0 n\xF3 s\u1EBD c\xF3 hi\u1EC7u l\u1EF1c v\xE0o ng\xE0y ti\u1EBFp theo 0:00 sau khi c\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t.\\n2, h\xE3y ch\u1ECDn gi\u1EA3i ng\xE2n h\xE0ng tu\u1EA7n v\xE0 kho\u1EA3n gi\u1EA3m gi\xE1 s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE2n ph\u1ED1i m\u1ED7i tu\u1EA7n trong s\u1ED1 n\xE0y (\u0111i\u1EC1n v\xE0o ph\u1EA1m vi 1-30) v\xE0 s\u1EBD c\xF3 hi\u1EC7u l\u1EF1c v\xE0o ng\xE0y ti\u1EBFp theo 0:00 sau khi c\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t. Th\u1EDDi gian ph\xE2n ph\u1ED1i l\xE0 th\u1EE9 Hai h\xE0ng tu\u1EA7n.\\n3, sau khi s\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED5i c\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t chu tr\xECnh, 0:00 s\u1EBD b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n chu tr\xECnh m\u1EDBi v\xE0o ng\xE0y h\xF4m sau v\xE0 ph\u1EA7n ch\u01B0a ph\xE1t h\xE0nh tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3 s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE1t h\xE0nh cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i.",
