    "Mahjong_BloodRiverRuleContent3_1": 'Tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng k\u1EBFt th\xFAc sau khi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i "D\xF2ng s\xF4ng m\xE1u" r\xFAt b\xE0i v\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c \u1EDF tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i r\xFAt b\xE0i t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n g\u1EB7p Lu\u1EADt b\xE0i, t\u01B0\u1EDDng b\xE0i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ch\u01A1i cho \u0111\u1EBFn khi h\u1EBFt t\u01B0\u1EDDng b\xE0i;',
