    "Mahjong_BloodRiverRuleTitle26": "Ba m\u01B0\u01A1i hai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\xE2m m\u1ED9",
    "Mahjong_BloodRiverRuleContent26_1": "[Ba con r\u1ED3ng v\xE0 b\u1EA3y c\u1EB7p] V\xE1n b\xE0i bao g\u1ED3m 7 c\u1EB7p v\xE0 c\xF3 3 b\u1ED9 4 l\xE1 b\xE0i gi\u1ED1ng h\u1EC7t nhau trong v\xE1n b\xE0i, kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 ch\u1EA1m ho\u1EB7c r\xFAt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c; tr\u1EEB 7 c\u1EB7p, r\u1ED3ng 7 c\u1EB7p, r\u1ED3ng \u0111\xF4i 7 c\u1EB7p, c\u1EEDa th\xF4ng, g\u1ED1c kh\xF4ng t\xEDnh;",
