    "UIVIPTipDialog": "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m n\xE0y mi\u1EC5n ph\xED sau khi m\u1EDF c\xE1c c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9 th\xE0nh vi\xEAn sau",
    "UIHadBuy": "\u0110\xE3 mua",
