    "UIDisbandFirst": "Sau khi gi\u1EA3i t\xE1n C\xE2u l\u1EA1c b\u1ED9, m\u1ECDi th\xF4ng tin v\u1EC1 nh\xE2n s\u1EF1, t\xE0i s\u1EA3n, d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u trong C\xE2u l\u1EA1c b\u1ED9 s\u1EBD b\u1ECB x\xF3a v\xE0 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c. OK B\u1EA1n c\xF3 mu\u1ED1n th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n thao t\xE1c n\xE0y kh\xF4ng?",
    "UIDisbandSecond": "X\xE1c nh\u1EADn l\u1EA1i xem b\u1EA1n c\xF3 mu\u1ED1n th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n thao t\xE1c gi\u1EA3i t\xE1n C\xE2u l\u1EA1c b\u1ED9 kh\xF4ng? N\xF3 s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i sau khi gi\u1EA3i th\u1EC3!",
