    "EnterGameplayErrorCode_9": "\u0110\u1EADp tr\u1EE9ng hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i kh\xF4ng h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng nhi\u1EC1u b\xE0n",
    "UIAllinBanChat": "L\u1EC7nh c\u1EA5m Allin",
    "UIAllinBanChatTips": "Sau K\xEDch ho\u1EA1t, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 ch\u1EB7n th\xF4ng tin t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c tr\xF2 chuy\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i kh\xE1c trong th\u1EDDi gian suy ngh\u0129 allin.",
    "MSG_Loading": "\u0110ang t\u1EA3i d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u",
