    "UIJackpot_Introduce": "<b><size=50>Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u Jackpot</size></b>\\nJackpot l\xE0 gi\u1EA3i l\u1EDBn ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn t\u1EA1i b\xE0n. Khi \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n b\xE0i v\xE0 ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t showdown, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i c\xF3 c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t Jackpot.\\n\\n<b><size=50>\u0110i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t</size></b>\\n1.D\xF9ng b\xE0i t\u1EA9y t\u1EA1o b\xE0i l\u1EDBn quy \u0111\u1ECBnh;\\n2.B\u1ECB b\xE0i m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n \u0111\xE1nh b\u1EA1i;\\n3.V\xE1n ph\u1EA3i k\u1EBFt th\xFAc b\u1EB1ng showdown b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng;\\n4.B\xE0n ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EE7 s\u1ED1 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1ED1i thi\u1EC3u.\\n\\n<b><size=50>Quy t\u1EAFc th\u01B0\u1EDFng</size></b>\\n1.Qu\u1EF9 Jackpot t\xEDch l\u0169y theo t\u1EEBng v\xE1n;\\n2.Khi k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t, th\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chia theo quy t\u1EAFc;\\n3.Th\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c trao cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u1EAFng v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xE1c c\xF9ng b\xE0n.\\n\\n<b><size=50>L\u01B0u \xFD</size></b>\\nM\u1ED7i m\u1EE9c blind c\xF3 qu\u1EF9 v\xE0 m\u1EE9c th\u01B0\u1EDFng Jackpot kh\xE1c nhau; blind c\xE0ng cao, th\u01B0\u1EDFng c\xE0ng l\u1EDBn.",
